        "Alice Hathaway Lee.",
        "Born at Chestnut",
        "Hill, July 29th 1861.",
        "I saw her first on",
        "Oct    1878; I wooed",
        "her for over a year",
        "before I won her; we",
        "were betrothed on Jan",
